flowchart LR
  subgraph A[Session A — recorded history]
    A1[Turn 1\nclosed]
    A2[Turn 2\nclosed]
    A3[Turn 3\nopen when process stops]
    A1 --> A2 --> A3
  end

  A2 -->|Resume same Session identity| R[Session A continues\nnext Input appends Turn 3]
  A3 -->|Crash Recovery| C[Keep valid persisted prefix\nclose unfinished tail as interrupted]
  C --> C2[Later Input opens a new Turn]

  A2 -->|Fork at a valid closed boundary| F0[Session B\nparentSession: A]
  F0 --> F1[Inherited frozen prefix\nTurn 1 + Turn 2]
  F1 --> F2[Independent future\nTurn 3′, Turn 4′, …]

  classDef source fill:#eef6ff,stroke:#4178be,color:#17324d
  classDef resume fill:#eefaf1,stroke:#3f8f5b,color:#183d27
  classDef recover fill:#fff7e8,stroke:#c7861f,color:#5b3b08
  classDef fork fill:#f5efff,stroke:#7d58b3,color:#35224e
  class A1,A2,A3 source
  class R resume
  class C,C2 recover
  class F0,F1,F2 fork
